From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] cacheflush: recognize Emscripten's predefined macro

Emscripten defines __EMSCRIPTEN__, but QEMU 11.0.2's cache-flush no-op path
checks only the project-supplied EMSCRIPTEN macro. The configured extra C
flag is not propagated to all Meson target compilation commands, causing
the generic clear-cache implementation to reach LLVM's unsupported wasm
llvm.clear_cache intrinsic. Accept the compiler-provided macro in both the
declaration and implementation guards.

Upstream baseline: QEMU v11.0.2 (e545d8bb7c3f).
Verification: build qemu-system-i386.js with the Web Git Bash adapter.

---
 include/qemu/cacheflush.h | 2 +-
 util/cacheflush.c         | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/qemu/cacheflush.h b/include/qemu/cacheflush.h
index 8c64b87..3854488 100644
--- a/include/qemu/cacheflush.h
+++ b/include/qemu/cacheflush.h
@@ -26,7 +26,7 @@ static inline void flush_idcache_range(uintptr_t rx, uintptr_t rw, size_t len)
     /* icache is coherent and does not require flushing. */
 }
 
-#elif defined(EMSCRIPTEN)
+#elif defined(EMSCRIPTEN) || defined(__EMSCRIPTEN__)
 
 static inline void flush_idcache_range(uintptr_t rx, uintptr_t rw, size_t len)
 {
diff --git a/util/cacheflush.c b/util/cacheflush.c
index c043c5f..8a6e5e1 100644
--- a/util/cacheflush.c
+++ b/util/cacheflush.c
@@ -227,7 +227,7 @@ static void __attribute__((constructor)) init_cache_info(void)
 
 /* Caches are coherent and do not require flushing; symbol inline. */
 
-#elif defined(EMSCRIPTEN)
+#elif defined(EMSCRIPTEN) || defined(__EMSCRIPTEN__)
 
 /* Wasm doesn't have executable region of memory. */
 
